7-add-foreground-notification-presentation` to `main`\\n2. **Link PR to issue #137** so it auto-closes on merge\\n3. **Test on iOS** — this API primarily affects iOS foreground notification display (Android uses notification channels instead)\\n4. **Verify on Android** — confirm no regressions; Android should continue showing notifications via its default channel behavior\\n\\n### Edge cases / notes\\n\\n- `setForegroundNotificationPresentationOptions` is **iOS-only** in practice — on Android it's a no-op. Android foreground notifications require a notification channel, which should already be configured via `firebase_messaging` defaults.\\n- The call is correctly placed after `requestPermission`, so permission is granted before setting presentation options.\\n- No additional dependencies or package changes required.", "status": "completed", "node_id": "plan", "node_name": "Plan", "node_type": "claude_agent", "duration_s": 12.3, "started_at": "2026-03-08T13:48:12.852831+00:00", "completed_at": "2026-03-08T13:48:25.163232+00:00"}, {"error": null, "output": "dev_result=https://github.com/Lenkomotive/doohub/pull/186", "status": "completed", "node_id": "develop", "node_name": "Develop", "node_type": "claude_agent", "duration_s": 22.7, "started_at": "2026-03-08T13:48:25.212839+00:00", "completed_at": "2026-03-08T13:48:47.902967+00:00"}, {"error": null, "output": "review_result=**APPROVED**\\n\\nThe change is correct and matches the issue requirements exactly. It adds `setForegroundNotificationPresentationOptions` with `alert`, `badge`, and `sound` enabled, placed logically right after `requestPermission` and before token retrieval. This is the standard Firebase Messaging API for enabling foreground notification display on iOS. The call is already inside the existing try/catch block, so errors are handled. No issues found., review_verdict=APPROVED", "status": "completed", "node_id": "review", "node_name": "Review", "node_type": "claude_agent", "duration_s": 15.2, "started